Copied packages: auth, auth/vkcalls, engine, engine/builtin, engine/vkcalls,
hostprofile, logger, protect, roomhint, transport, transport/common,
transport/vp8channel. Tests that depend on parts of olcRTC not copied here
were left out.

Changes made in free-turn-proxy:
  - all files: import paths moved from github.com/openlibrecommunity/olcrtc/internal
    to this module's internal/sfu.
  - engine/builtin/builtin.go: only the vkcalls provider and engine are registered;
    the other providers and engines are not included.
  - transport/vp8channel/kcp.go: buffer profile read from hostprofile directly
    instead of the runtime package, which is not included.

sfu.go is new code of free-turn-proxy that connects this transport to the
core (client handshake with the bridge, datagram routing).

Third-party modules used by this code: pion/* (MIT), xtaci/kcp-go (MIT),
gorilla/websocket (BSD-3-Clause), theodorsm/covert-dtls (MIT).
